<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Thursday were forecast to see rain in the west and sun in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see scattered rain and a high of 18 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see showers in the west, sun in the east with highs of 23 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sun with highs of 19 to 25 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
